  "_schema": "aicad.iso286/1",
  "_citation": "ISO 286-2:2010 + ISO 286-1:2010",
  "_notes": [
    "IT grades IT5-IT12 computed from i = 0.45*D^(1/3) + 0.001*D, D = geometric mean of range bounds (um), rounded to nearest integer um. source.kind='closed_form'.",
    "Fundamental deviations for lowercase shafts a-h and js: formula-derived (source.kind='closed_form'). Shafts k,m,n,p,r,s: tabulated from ISO 286-1/-2 shaft deviation tables (source.kind='table').",
    "Hole deviations: H only (EI=0, ES=+IT) in this release; K/M/N/P/R/S require the delta-correction rule (ISO 286-1 clause 5.3) and are deferred (marked 'todo'). The spot-check tests only exercise H holes.",
    "D_mean convention: for range [lo, hi], D = sqrt(lo*hi) except 1-3 where D = sqrt(1*3) = 1.732 mm.",
    "All deviations in micrometres (um). Sign convention: positive = above nominal, negative = below nominal.",
    "Ranges use ISO 286 'over X up to and including Y' convention (e.g. 50mm falls in 30-50 range, not 50-80)."
  ],

